ounty&rsquo;s 6 grids in Harvey County has a record from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025, February to March on the middle of the grids came in at 22% of normal, then June to July ran 170% of normal. Grid 21431 had its driest year in 1966 at 46%. On grid 21430, the preliminary estimate for July to August 2026 is 25.2.</p>"}
